WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.716 --> 00:00:11.436
Switching from Strong or Hevy? Bring your old workouts along. The file is read on your phone, and never uploaded.

2
00:00:11.794 --> 00:00:12.754
Here's how.

3
00:00:13.114 --> 00:00:17.274
Tap the person icon at the top, then Your data.

4
00:00:17.635 --> 00:00:21.635
Tap Import from another app, and pick the app you're coming from.

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.920
Then tap the Choose file button, and pick the export you saved.

6
00:00:26.274 --> 00:00:32.914
RepBunny matches each exercise. When the match is right, tap the Yes, same one button.

7
00:00:33.268 --> 00:00:35.508
Then tap the Import button.

8
00:00:35.867 --> 00:00:39.627
Pick lb or kg, and tap Import again.

9
00:00:39.985 --> 00:00:43.025
They're in! Tap the See my progress button.

10
00:00:43.383 --> 00:00:46.423
Your records and charts pick up right where you left off.
